    "testimonials_hgmr9B": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_MTGmrT": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "review_content": "<p>EZG has become one of our top vendors. From forming, welding, laser parts, machining, and powder coating there attention for detail is second to none. Customer service, billing, delivery, and management all take great pride in providing a level of customer service that is seldom found in today’s hectic markets. For a consistent and trustworthy manufacturing experience I trust EZG.</p>",
            "author_name": "Liam Johnson",
            "author_description": "Product Designer"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_T3fW3D": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "review_content": "<p>EZG Manufacturing has become an exceptional partner of Aerodyne.  They take great pride in their fabrication and even greater pride in their customer service.  Kenny has consistently turned around quotes expeditiously and is very responsive to any questions or concerns.  It doesn’t take long to realize that the importance of keeping the customer happy is fully engrained within EZG’s culture.  They are an incredible help whenever special circumstances arise and always go to great lengths to finish projects within the requested deadline.  We would highly recommend EZG Manufacturing for your fabrication needs.</p>",
            "author_name": "Cole, Solberg, Business Manager",
            "author_description": "Aerodyne Environmental"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_BqzDzr": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "review_content": "<p>EZG is very reliable with their quality and delivery. Whenever we need anything Steve Chichester (Custom Fabrication Lead) takes care of us and Dan Kern (Plant Manager) is there to back him up. We first used EZG for our larger tanks but have since switched all our tank fabrication to EZG because of excellent quality, price, and delivery.</p>",
            "author_name": "Joe Grimm, President",
            "author_description": "Grimm Scientific Industries"
          }
        }
      },
